Below is a single *SEARCH/REPLACE* patch that stops Prism’s F# highlighter from eating your `(*)` “multiply-as-function” syntax as an empty comment. We simply require at least one character inside `(* … *)` when Prism tries to match a block comment.

```javascript
### components/prism-fsharp.js
